WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
(light instrumental music)

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.840
- Camouflage is important in the oceans.

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:06.456
It's a cutthroat world
outside these submarine walls.

00:00:06.456 --> 00:00:08.684
Today, we're talking about seahorses,

00:00:08.684 --> 00:00:11.623
and their ability to camouflage.

00:00:11.623 --> 00:00:14.740
(suspenseful instrumental music)

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:17.383
My grandfather Jacques
Cousteau always stood out

00:00:17.383 --> 00:00:19.334
in a crowd because of his style,

00:00:19.334 --> 00:00:22.751
but these seahorses do just the opposite.

00:00:26.315 --> 00:00:29.315
Seahorses are masters of camouflage,

00:00:31.247 --> 00:00:32.657
and the pygmy seahorse is one of

00:00:32.657 --> 00:00:36.147
the most well-camouflaged
species in the ocean,

00:00:36.147 --> 00:00:39.553
and the smallest variety
of seahorses that exist.

00:00:39.553 --> 00:00:42.220
They're the size of a paperclip.

00:00:43.122 --> 00:00:45.966
In fact, the pygmy
seahorse wasn't discovered

00:00:45.966 --> 00:00:50.133
until someone was examining
a piece of coral it was on.

00:00:52.210 --> 00:00:53.043
(light string music)

00:00:53.043 --> 00:00:56.281
Seahorses, much like
chameleons, can change color.

00:00:56.281 --> 00:00:58.583
They change color to confuse predators,

00:00:58.583 --> 00:01:00.872
as well as to convey
emotions to one another,

00:01:00.872 --> 00:01:02.691
especially during courtship.

00:01:02.691 --> 00:01:04.422
The speed at which they change color,

00:01:04.422 --> 00:01:06.153
well that depends on what's happening.

00:01:06.153 --> 00:01:08.526
As a response to fear, it's rapid,

00:01:08.526 --> 00:01:12.693
whereas if it's due to hormonal
changes, it's much slower.

00:01:13.723 --> 00:01:15.091
- It's gone.

00:01:15.091 --> 00:01:19.932
- What, what do you mean
it's gone? (sighing)

00:01:19.932 --> 00:01:22.515
No, no, no, no, it's right there.

00:01:23.392 --> 00:01:24.892
Stealthy seahorse.

